<h3 class="article-subheading" id="authority-surfaces">Applying the meaning to work</h3>
{{AUTHORITY_CONTEXT}}
<h3 class="article-subheading" id="authority-agent">How accepted meaning informs later work</h3>
<div class="prose"><p>A definition can influence a schema, validator, task view or later decision through explicit bindings. The implementation and the observed effect must be identifiable too. Accepting a definition does not itself execute software, change a database or authorize every action connected to the subject.</p></div>
